    "explanation": "Decision on Trip TRP-00617 and the SGD 4.00 no-show cancellation fee. To the rider: the fee is refunded in full. The platform's own GPS trace (EV-GPS-00617) shows the driver entering the pickup geofence at 07:15:50 and his longest continuous in-geofence hold running 230 seconds, ending 07:19:40; the trip record (EV-TRIP-00617) shows he cancelled at 07:19:50. Under POL-NS-01(c) the waiting clock runs from the first qualifying in-geofence fix, not from the 'arrived' tap, so the 300-second STANDARD minimum was never reached — a 70-second shortfall — and under POL-NS-06 the cancellation fee is not chargeable and is refunded in full, whether or not you were present and whether or not you answered anything. The driver also terminated at 07:19:50, before the minimum would have elapsed at 07:20:50. Your own track (rider fixes within 11.3 m of the pin, stationary, 07:15:40 to 07:19:43) corroborates that you were there, but it is not needed for this outcome: POL-NS-04 cannot be run because the chat log (EV-CHAT-00617) holds zero messages and in_app_calls is empty, so its limb (a) fails and neither side relied on it. To the driver: your arrival was genuine. Both advocates accept, and I accept, that the arrival marker was true — you were 6.91 m from the pin at the 07:15:52 arrival event and your trace peaked at 13.0 km/h, well inside the 300 m and 15 km/h POL-NS-05 thresholds — so no false-arrival finding and no POL-NS-05(ii) referral attaches. Limb (d)'s reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW is one the clause recognises, but the charge still fails on limb (c): the required dwell was not reached. Because POL-NS-06 displaces the charge, POL-NS-07 compensation of 80 percent (SGD 3.20 of the SGD 4.00 line) is not payable, and the anti-farming check is not tripped in any event (1 termination against 110 completed trips in 30 days; only the two fields POL-GEN-01 permits were used). Dwell cannot be padded under POL-NS-06(i): the only traffic advisory, EV-ADVIS-00617-01, is MISSING (weight 0.0, MISSING_ARTIFACT), so limb (i) is unavailable, and the trace shows a single in-geofence run (run_count 1) in any case. Evidence and confidence: the deciding fact — the dwell shortfall — is carried by EV-GPS-00617 and EV-TRIP-00617, both at weight 1.0, so confidence is not capped and no artifact below 1.0 decides anything. The one impaired artifact, EV-ADVIS-00617-01, is used only for its absence and carries no fact for the ruling. No escalation applies under POL-NS-09 (confidence is above the 0.70 floor, the artifacts agree, and neither profile limb is met), and no clause produces a referral. Amount: the fare breakdown (EV-FARE-00617) carries a single cancellation_fee line of SGD 4.00, payment status CHARGED, refund issued SGD 0.00, reconciling with the fee_schedule resolution rule (STANDARD zone fee SGD 4.00; RYDE_X tier fee SGD 4.00). The full SGD 4.00 is returned to the rider.",
